<!--
  Parallel branches and fan-out.

  rung 1:  |==| A |==| B |==+==( Out1 )      Out1 := (A AND B) OR (C AND NOT D)
           |==| C |==|/D|==+

  rung 2:  |==| E |==+==========( X )==( Z )  a coil passes power on: Z = X
                     +==| F |===( Y )         E fans out: latched once, so Y's
                                              branch sees E as the rung found it

  rung 3 is split with a connector/continuation pair (a long rung drawn on two
  lines):  |==| G |==>K>        >K>==| H |==( W )
-->
